  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "600801",
      "subQuestName": "前往希汐岛将药交给菈乌玛",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60080101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60080101": {
            "id": "60080101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "又过去了几天，这里怎么样了呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080102"
            ]
          },
          "60080102": {
            "id": "60080102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "变化似乎没有想象中那么大。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080103"
            ]
          },
          "60080103": {
            "id": "60080103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "看来逐渐稳定下来了呢，菈乌玛真有本事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080104"
            ]
          },
          "60080104": {
            "id": "60080104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "菈乌玛，我们来啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080105"
            ]
          },
          "60080105": {
            "id": "60080105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这几天怎么样？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080106"
            ]
          },
          "60080106": {
            "id": "60080106",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "收尾工作比我想象中复杂很多，打理积攒下来的问题并不是个容易的事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080107"
            ]
          },
          "60080107": {
            "id": "60080107",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "按照现在的进度，估计还需要几周的时间。所幸，留下的人也像是扫除了心中的迷惘，变得更加积极了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080108"
            ]
          },
          "60080108": {
            "id": "60080108",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "仿佛此时此刻，他们才真正邂逅了属于自己的信仰。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080109"
            ]
          },
          "60080109": {
            "id": "60080109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这都是你的功劳啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080110"
            ]
          },
          "60080110": {
            "id": "60080110",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "不要这么说，我本应该更早去做这件事的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080111"
            ]
          },
          "60080111": {
            "id": "60080111",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "最近我都在调养自己的身体，既然「月髓」现在由你保管，我应该能试着帮你探究过去的事了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080112"
            ]
          },
          "60080112": {
            "id": "60080112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "谢谢你，还记得这件事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080113"
            ]
          },
          "60080113": {
            "id": "60080113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "说起来，关于那个诡影，你听说过什么新消息吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080114"
            ]
          },
          "60080114": {
            "id": "60080114",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "嗯，我尝试问过一些人，但没有什么情报。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080115"
            ]
          },
          "60080115": {
            "id": "60080115",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "你们那边如何？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080116"
            ]
          },
          "60080116": {
            "id": "60080116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "进展不多，但现在是这样…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080117"
            ]
          },
          "60080117": {
            "id": "60080117",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "大概明白了…你们的工作也不比任何人轻松。请多照顾好自己的身体。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080118"
            ]
          },
          "60080118": {
            "id": "60080118",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "#那么，{NICKNAME}，请到这边来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080119"
            ]
          },
          "60080119": {
            "id": "60080119",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080120"
            ]
          },
          "60080120": {
            "id": "60080120",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你看到什么了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080121"
            ]
          },
          "60080121": {
            "id": "60080121",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（这里是…挪德卡莱？我好像对这风景有印象…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080122"
            ]
          },
          "60080122": {
            "id": "60080122",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（天空中那是…一颗流星？）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080123"
            ]
          },
          "60080123": {
            "id": "60080123",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（…！不对！那是我们的飞船！）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080124"
            ]
          },
          "60080124": {
            "id": "60080124",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "结、结束了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080125"
            ]
          },
          "60080125": {
            "id": "60080125",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "这似乎是很久以前发生的事，我感受到的记忆涌动十分紊乱，凭我的力量只能看到这么多信息了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080126"
            ]
          },
          "60080126": {
            "id": "60080126",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（至少知道了我们的飞船迫降在挪德卡莱的位置…好像是在星砂滩附近。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080127"
            ]
          },
          "60080127": {
            "id": "60080127",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#（也和{M#荧}{F#哥哥}告诉我的事实对得上…但，果然还想知道更多…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080128"
            ]
          },
          "60080128": {
            "id": "60080128",
            "speakerId": 15380,
            "speakerName": "努昂诺塔",
            "text": "！！！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080129"
            ]
          },
          "60080129": {
            "id": "60080129",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸，你突然怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080130"
            ]
          },
          "60080130": {
            "id": "60080130",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "花的颜色变了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080131"
            ]
          },
          "60080131": {
            "id": "60080131",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（这种花是「少女」力量的写照。难道说她的身体又…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080132"
            ]
          },
          "60080132": {
            "id": "60080132",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（我记得她好像说过，想用「月髓」来恢复一些力量…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080133"
            ]
          },
          "60080133": {
            "id": "60080133",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "派蒙…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080134"
            ]
          },
          "60080134": {
            "id": "60080134",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯，我懂！我们还是快去见她吧，看看有没有什么能帮到她的地方。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080135"
            ]
          },
          "60080135": {
            "id": "60080135",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "那就拜托你们了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080136"
            ]
          },
          "60080136": {
            "id": "60080136",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对了，这个是你之前拜托「秘闻馆」准备的药。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080137"
            ]
          },
          "60080137": {
            "id": "60080137",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "谢谢你们专程送过来，帮大忙了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080138"
            ]
          },
          "60080138": {
            "id": "60080138",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "菈乌玛",
            "text": "另外…我有一个推测。关于你的飞船，或许「库塔{RUBY#[S]月之少女}尔」能为你展现更多片段。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080139"
            ]
          },
          "60080139": {
            "id": "60080139",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对哦！她可是「月神」呢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080140"
            ]
          },
          "60080140": {
            "id": "60080140",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "但首先还是确保她没什么大碍吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080141"
            ]
          },
          "60080141": {
            "id": "60080141",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那我们待会儿见！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "600802",
      "subQuestName": "前往银月之庭见「少女」",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60080401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60080401": {
            "id": "60080401",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "嗯？你说什么，可以再说一遍吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080402"
            ]
          },
          "60080402": {
            "id": "60080402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊？就是你…呃，曾经的同僚？「木偶」和我们一起在星砂滩的时候，好像也被「狂猎」给打败了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080403"
            ]
          },
          "60080403": {
            "id": "60080403",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080404"
            ]
          },
          "60080404": {
            "id": "60080404",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呃…你刚才是笑了一下吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080405"
            ]
          },
          "60080405": {
            "id": "60080405",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…没有。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080406"
            ]
          },
          "60080406": {
            "id": "60080406",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（绝对是笑了吧！）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080407"
            ]
          },
          "60080407": {
            "id": "60080407",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你和她关系不好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080408"
            ]
          },
          "60080408": {
            "id": "60080408",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不，只是能想象到她不服气的表情，觉得很有意思。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080409"
            ]
          },
          "60080409": {
            "id": "60080409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "她当时好像很受挫。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080410"
            ]
          },
          "60080410": {
            "id": "60080410",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "那只是暂时性的，她很擅长自我调节。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080411"
            ]
          },
          "60080411": {
            "id": "60080411",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "话题扯远了，既然我们已经知道盯上「月髓」的家伙这么危险，你真的还要随身携带它吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080412"
            ]
          },
          "60080412": {
            "id": "60080412",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "若是「愚人众」的信息可靠。那当猎月人施展全力的时候，整个挪德卡莱加起来都不是他的对手。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080413"
            ]
          },
          "60080413": {
            "id": "60080413",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "现在…或许有什么原因限制了他吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080414"
            ]
          },
          "60080414": {
            "id": "60080414",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080415"
            ]
          },
          "60080415": {
            "id": "60080415",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "在决定之前，我有件事想拜托哥伦比娅。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080416"
            ]
          },
          "60080416": {
            "id": "60080416",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "什么事？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080417"
            ]
          },
          "60080417": {
            "id": "60080417",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#不知道你能否让我看到，我和{M#妹妹}{F#哥哥}的飞船刚降落到挪德卡莱时，发生的事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080418"
            ]
          },
          "60080418": {
            "id": "60080418",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "可以哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080419"
            ]
          },
          "60080419": {
            "id": "60080419",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "答应得好干脆！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080420"
            ]
          },
          "60080420": {
            "id": "60080420",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我说过，这对我来说不过是捧起一束月光而已，没什么难的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080421"
            ]
          },
          "60080421": {
            "id": "60080421",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "手给我。做好准备。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080422"
            ]
          },
          "60080422": {
            "id": "60080422",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080423"
            ]
          },
          "60080423": {
            "id": "60080423",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（和之前看到的一样，只不过更为清晰了…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080424"
            ]
          },
          "60080424": {
            "id": "60080424",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（还好当时安全迫降了…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080425"
            ]
          },
          "60080425": {
            "id": "60080425",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（……）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080426"
            ]
          },
          "60080426": {
            "id": "60080426",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（好像过了很久…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080427"
            ]
          },
          "60080427": {
            "id": "60080427",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#（{M#荧}{F#哥哥}和我应该还在里面，我们居然在飞船里待了这么长时间，{M#荧}{F#哥哥}究竟是什么时候出去的呢？）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080428"
            ]
          },
          "60080428": {
            "id": "60080428",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#（咦？！那是…{M#荧}{F#哥哥}？！）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080429"
            ]
          },
          "60080429": {
            "id": "60080429",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（为什么…明明飞船迫降之后，根本没有人出去过！飞船的门在此之前也没被打开过！）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080430"
            ]
          },
          "60080430": {
            "id": "60080430",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这里是…哪儿？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080431"
            ]
          },
          "60080431": {
            "id": "60080431",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Sibling",
            "text": "#{M#哥哥}{F#荧}！快走，我们离开这里！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080432"
            ]
          },
          "60080432": {
            "id": "60080432",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…欸？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080433"
            ]
          },
          "60080433": {
            "id": "60080433",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你…你还好吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080434"
            ]
          },
          "60080434": {
            "id": "60080434",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们的飞船…迫降后过了很长一段时间…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080435"
            ]
          },
          "60080435": {
            "id": "60080435",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#从没有人离开过飞船，但{M#荧}{F#哥哥}…却是从飞船外找到的我…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080436"
            ]
          },
          "60080436": {
            "id": "60080436",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？！这…这怎么可能！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080437"
            ]
          },
          "60080437": {
            "id": "60080437",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我不知道…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080438"
            ]
          },
          "60080438": {
            "id": "60080438",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "回忆中隐藏的秘密就像是饼干，咬一口就会撒得到处都是。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080439"
            ]
          },
          "60080439": {
            "id": "60080439",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（这件事…太蹊跷了，我必须要追查清楚。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080440"
            ]
          },
          "60080440": {
            "id": "60080440",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（但正如奈芙尔所说，如果挪德卡莱在这之前就遭遇毁灭性的灾难，那就无从查起了…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080441"
            ]
          },
          "60080441": {
            "id": "60080441",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080442"
            ]
          },
          "60080442": {
            "id": "60080442",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "「月髓」就交给我吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080443"
            ]
          },
          "60080443": {
            "id": "60080443",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸、欸？呃…好吧，既然你都这么说了。但这个东西…唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080444"
            ]
          },
          "60080444": {
            "id": "60080444",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "需要我帮忙吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080445"
            ]
          },
          "60080445": {
            "id": "60080445",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你指的是？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080446"
            ]
          },
          "60080446": {
            "id": "60080446",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我可以帮你们隐藏「月髓」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080447"
            ]
          },
          "60080447": {
            "id": "60080447",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "真的吗！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080448"
            ]
          },
          "60080448": {
            "id": "60080448",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "本身它在你体内就不易察觉，我可以再教给你一些使用月矩力的办法，进一步隐蔽「月髓」的气息。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080449"
            ]
          },
          "60080449": {
            "id": "60080449",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "就像这样…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080450"
            ]
          },
          "60080450": {
            "id": "60080450",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哦！就像是一个护盾呢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080451"
            ]
          },
          "60080451": {
            "id": "60080451",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（这是…好轻柔的感觉…就像月光一样…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080452"
            ]
          },
          "60080452": {
            "id": "60080452",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "感觉到了吗？现在试着维持它。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080453"
            ]
          },
          "60080453": {
            "id": "60080453",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080454"
            ]
          },
          "60080454": {
            "id": "60080454",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "你学得很快。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080455"
            ]
          },
          "60080455": {
            "id": "60080455",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好像还挺结实的，这关键时候都可以用来防身了吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080456"
            ]
          },
          "60080456": {
            "id": "60080456",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "谢谢你教我…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080457"
            ]
          },
          "60080457": {
            "id": "60080457",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哥伦比娅平时真的都在这里吗？也不出去走走？虽然现在出去可能有些危险…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080458"
            ]
          },
          "60080458": {
            "id": "60080458",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080459"
            ]
          },
          "60080459": {
            "id": "60080459",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "不喜欢陌生人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080460"
            ]
          },
          "60080460": {
            "id": "60080460",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们算「熟人」了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080461"
            ]
          },
          "60080461": {
            "id": "60080461",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "比陌生人好一点。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080464"
            ]
          },
          "60080464": {
            "id": "60080464",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对呀对呀，现在「霜月之子」和以前也不一样了，你说不定会喜欢的呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080465"
            ]
          },
          "60080465": {
            "id": "60080465",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080466"
            ]
          },
          "60080466": {
            "id": "60080466",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "我会考虑的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080467"
            ]
          },
          "60080467": {
            "id": "60080467",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "她看起来有些累了呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080468"
            ]
          },
          "60080468": {
            "id": "60080468",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "好久没说这么多话了吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080469"
            ]
          },
          "60080469": {
            "id": "60080469",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "总之，谢谢你愿意帮我们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080470"
            ]
          },
          "60080470": {
            "id": "60080470",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "…这没什么。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60080471"
            ]
          },
          "60080471": {
            "id": "60080471",
            "speakerId": 1318,
            "speakerName": "「少女」",
            "text": "这里的花，喜欢你这样的客人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "600803",
